--- log
getch 97 a
getch 259 KEY_UP
getch 260 KEY_LEFT
getch 265 KEY_F(1)
getch 263 KEY_BACKSPACE
getch 13 ^M
getch 98 b
KEY_UP 1 KEY_LEFT 1 KEY_F(1) 1 KEY_BACKSPACE 1
nodelay: getch ERR
ungetch OK
getch after ungetch z
--- [exit 0]
